OL,4,BCricket Australia sets up 'safe space' 
OL,5,Bfor players to share sandpapergate     
OL,6,Bexperiences                            
OL,7,GCricket Australia has launched an      
OL,8,Gindependent "forum" for players and    
OL,9,Gstaff involved in the sandpapergate    
OL,10,Gscandal to share their version of      
OL,11,Gevents.                                
OL,13,FIn a memoir released earlier this      
OL,14,Fmonth, former player Usman Khawaja     
OL,15,Fclaimed the entire Australia team knew 
OL,16,Fof the plot to tamper with the ball    
OL,17,Fduring a 2018 Test in South Africa,    
OL,18,Fcontradicting the investigation at the 
OL,19,Ftime.                                  
